Spartronics ended their 2nd day of regional competition in the 16th seed. We averaged 129.44 points per match. We look forward to tomorrow when we play three more qualification matches.  Tomorrow also brings alliance selection, playoffs, and the presentation of the Engineering Inspiration award, which Spartronics is competing for. To watch all this and more, tune into the FIRST Livestream(link below). For up to date information on the standings and where Spartronics stands, go to [http://frc-events.usfirst.org/2015/PNCMP/rankings](http://frc-events.usfirst.org/2015/PNCMP/rankings)

![1382040_440074452827612_2648546299637601502_n](../../assets/posts/spartronics-finishes-16th-after-2nd-day-of-competition/1382040_440074452827612_2648546299637601502_n.jpg)

FRC Livestream

[http://www.ustream.tv/channel/pnwfirst-red](http://www.ustream.tv/channel/pnwfirst-red)  

